; onnxruntime-node's postinstall downloads a CUDA EP tarball from the GitHub
; release for v1.21.0. That tag was removed upstream (404 since 2026-11-18),
; which makes `npm ci` fail on every runner and blocks all five CI workflows.
; No runner here has a GPU, so the CUDA EP was never used; the CPU EP is still
; installed. A developer who needs CUDA can override with an explicit CLI flag.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
